# Studio Labs Journey: Find Streaming Provider for a Movie
#
# 1. Launch ICanHazStream on the emulator
# 2. View the trending movies list on the Explore screen
# 3. Tap on "Dune: Part Two"
# 4. Switch to the "Stream" tab
# 5. Verify Netflix is available at AU$16.99/mo in 4K
# 6. Tap "Watch" button to trigger provider launch
